      <button class="w-full py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-mystic to-gold-mystic-400 text-on-tertiary-fixed font-bold rounded-xl text-sm shadow-lg shadow-gold-mystic/20 hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all active:scale-95">Upgrade Now</button>
